#!/bin/sh
less -R <<'TXT'

  COMPUVAC OPERATOR MANUAL
  ────────────────────────

  CTRL+SPACE     Program index. Type a name, press RETURN.
                 The program takes the whole screen. Quit it to return.
  F2             File store (Midnight Commander). F4 edits a file.
  F10            This manual.

  comp-src install NAME     Compile and install software.
  comp-src remove NAME      Decommission software.
  comp-src update           Bring the core store up to date.
  comp-src search WORDS     Search the archive.
  compuvac tune             Fit the compiler to this processor.
  compuvac rebuild          Recompile everything, the kernel too, here.

  In the program index: NETWORK joins Wi-Fi, POWER sets the power
  profile, BLUETOOTH pairs devices, FIRMWARE updates it via LVFS,
  FINGERPRINT enrols one (doas then accepts a fingerprint).
  Brightness, volume and microphone keys work as marked.
  Closing the lid, or pressing the power button, suspends.

  CTRL+ALT+F2    Maintenance terminal.
  logout         End the session.

  Q to close this manual.
TXT
